# heavy assets live with the skill so its ignore rules travel with the folder. .models and .cache carry NO
# trailing slash on purpose: in a linked worktree they are SYMLINKS to the primary's copies (dt install), and
# a dir-only pattern ignores neither a symlink nor a path that does not exist yet (measured 2026-09-07).
# (module extraction, copies) — never committed wherever the skill lands
.models
.cache
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
